%description:
Tests that DumbTcp stops its retransmission timer when all data, the FIN
included, is acknowledged (RFC 6298 section 5.2). The client sends 1000 bytes
at t=1 and closes at t=1.5; the server acknowledges the FIN at t=1.503 and does
not close, so the client waits in FIN_WAIT_2. Before the repair, the timer of
DumbTcp sent the acknowledged FIN again every 2 s until the run ended.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib
sim-time-limit = 10s

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_tcp.tcpAlgorithmClass = "DumbTcp"
*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 1000"
*.cli_app.tClose=1.5s
*.tcptester.script=""

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:1001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.203 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1001 win 16384 
cli_tcp: ESTABLISHED --> FIN_WAIT_1  (on CLOSE)
[1.501 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A F ack 501 win 16384 
srv_tcp: ESTABLISHED --> CLOSE_WAIT  (on RCV_FIN)
[1.503 B003] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1002 win 16384 
cli_tcp: FIN_WAIT_1 --> FIN_WAIT_2  (on RCV_ACK)
[10.000] tcpdump finished, A:4 B:3 segments
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
